[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5131990785","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121899#issuecomment-5131990785","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121899","id":5131990785,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMeP3AQ","user":{"login":"Goldenlion5648","id":32916571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTE2NTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32916571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648","html_url":"https://github.com/Goldenlion5648","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-30T14:18:07Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T14:18:31Z","body":"Can I ask which part of this people are reacting with :confused: to?\r\n\r\nIf it's the performance hit, this could get the same treatment as `for i in range` where a special case is made to optimize it in separate PR. If it's the half done performance metrics, I can redo it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5131990785/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5181977048","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121899#issuecomment-5181977048","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121899","id":5181977048,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNN6x2A","user":{"login":"JoNax97","id":10124534,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTI0NTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10124534?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97","html_url":"https://github.com/JoNax97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-04T16:41:07Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T16:41:32Z","body":"Personally I don't understand this part: \r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfor pos, value in enumerate(my_array, 15):\r\n\tprints(pos, value)\r\n# Result:\r\n# 15 7\r\n# 16 4\r\n# 17 9\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf the array does not contains keys 15-17, why does it return elements 0-3 instead of failing?\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5181977048/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5182127397","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121899#issuecomment-5182127397","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121899","id":5182127397,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNOD9JQ","user":{"login":"Goldenlion5648","id":32916571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTE2NTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32916571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648","html_url":"https://github.com/Goldenlion5648","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-04T16:56:15Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T16:56:15Z","body":"@JoNax97 It's the same as python's enumerate:\r\n```python\r\n>>> my_array = [7, 4, 9]\r\n>>> for pos, value in enumerate(my_array, 15):\r\n......  print(pos, value)\r\n   ... \r\n15 7\r\n16 4\r\n17 9\r\n```\r\nThe second argument in enumerate is a value for a separate variable that is counting up, not meant to be the index. Useful for the case where you wanted to iterate through the whole array, but don't want to write something like `i+1` everywhere. In which case you would use \r\n```python\r\nfor i, value in enumerate(my_array, 1):\r\n\t...\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf you don't want to iterate the whole array, you could use [slice](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_array.html#class-array-method-slice)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5182127397/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5182262177","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121899#issuecomment-5182262177","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121899","id":5182262177,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNOMLoQ","user":{"login":"JoNax97","id":10124534,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTI0NTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10124534?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97","html_url":"https://github.com/JoNax97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-04T17:09:02Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T17:09:02Z","body":"Id personally leave that argument out. It's confusing at first glance and doesn't seem to add much. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5182262177/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5263304756","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121899#issuecomment-5263304756","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121899","id":5263304756,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABObeoNA","user":{"login":"PhairZ","id":123702514,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1-M8g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123702514?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ","html_url":"https://github.com/PhairZ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-12T06:45:59Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T06:45:59Z","body":"This is a very nice feature I wanted for a while. The performance can be made better IMO with better handling of variant args, and reserving memory would probably be the best optimization in this case.\n\nAlso, I think it should be made clear that if an array's element is passed by value, then the behavior won't be the same as usual.\n\nOne might think that:\n```gdscript\nvar nums = [2, 5, 6]\nfor n in nums:\n    n += 1\n\nprint(nums) # Prints: [3, 6, 7]\n```\nIs the same as:\n```gdscript\nvar nums = [2, 5, 6]\nfor i, n in enumerate(nums):\n    n += 1\n\nprint(nums) # Prints: [2, 5, 6]\n```\nBut what would be the same is something like:\n```gdscript\nvar nums = [2, 5, 6]\nfor i, n in enumerate(nums):\n    nums[i] += 1\n\nprint(nums) # Prints: [3, 6, 7]\n```\nSo I think we should make this more clear in the documentation.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5263304756/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]